  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "After Ge tribe takes Zheng tribe camp, Gu Masters load gathered resources onto thirty Blue Farm Slug Gu used as transportation troops.",
        "chapters": [
          484
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "fac_ge_tribe",
          "fac_zheng_tribe",
          "fac_gu_masters"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "When Ge tribe later approaches under wolf-group protection, the text calls the cargo carriers farm slug Gu. Large numbers of them move with black skin fat armor beetles that also carry huge amounts of resources, while lizard house Gu walk on four limbs and a blue Ge tribe flag marks the main tent.",
        "chapters": [
          499
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "ge-tribe-march",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Slugs advance with stomachs stuffed until an original size of three elephants becomes a mound-like hill. To keep them from freezing, three Gu Masters tend each slug, clearing frost and using fire path Gu for warmth.",
        "chapters": [
          546
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
